          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c2_mnist_scale_ideal_downsampling_achie",
          "text": "On MNIST-scale with ideal downsampling, the model achieves the highest accuracy at ninety-eight point nine percent, the highest scale-consistency at ninety-seven percent, and, crucially, an absolute zero equivariance error, while competing methods like DISCO show errors around zero point four.",
