          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c3_advantage_largest_harder_stl10_scale",
          "text": "The advantage is largest on the harder STL10-scale natural-image benchmark, where the model reaches seventy-three percent accuracy against roughly fifty-eight percent for the strongest baseline, a gain of about fifteen points, still with exactly zero equivariance error.",
